From 3d5ac5931f551d1281ed3881d6124e15ab62db58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redesign <k@local>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 07:31:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] redesign: Laterite & Monsoon design system + Risk Horizon

Replaces the emoji-and-green-card UI with a design system grounded in the
subject: Jharkhand laterite red, paddy green, monsoon blue, painted
signboard typography (Archivo display + IBM Plex Mono for every number).

- New: RiskHorizon, a seven-day risk band above the alert list. Column
  height and colour encode each day's risk using the same thresholds as
  api/rules/definitions.py, so the strip and the advisories agree.
- New: Icons.tsx line set. Emoji rendered differently on every Android
  build and were read aloud by screen readers as unicode names.
- Rewrote globals.css, layout.tsx, page.tsx, login, onboarding,
  FarmClient, AlertClient, DemoBanner.
- Accessibility floor: visible focus rings, reduced-motion honoured,
  48px targets, aria labels on icon-only controls, 360px layout floor.
- Skeleton first paint instead of a bare spinner.
